# TypeScript libraries

Application code imports runtime classes from `@qlever-llc/trellis` and generated descriptors or participants from the project-local `.trellis/ts` tree.

```ts
import { TrellisClient } from "@qlever-llc/trellis";
import { participant } from "../../.trellis/ts/participants/orders-app/mod.ts";

const client = await TrellisClient.connect({ participant, auth });
```

Do not construct API or participant metadata in TypeScript. Author it in native IDL, run `trellis generate`, and treat generated files as disposable build products.
